          "text": "Neck pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing midline and paraspinal neck pain extending into the right shoulder, rated 4–7/10. Worse at the end of the workday, with sitting at a computer, and with driving."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
