        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Intermittent limb heaviness and shaky or clumsy feeling"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports intermittent heaviness and a shaky or clumsy feeling in the right arm more than the left, and sometimes in the right leg. Episodes last minutes to 1 hour and occur several times per day. Onset timing is uncertain; she has said it may have started last week or straight after the crash."
      }
    },
